# Build context of .deploy/api/Dockerfile (repository root): only what the API image needs.
# The last matching line wins, so the re-included packages come first and the
# generated folders after them (a host node_modules would replace the image's).
.git
e2e
tools
packages/*
!packages/common
!packages/core
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/tmp
**/coverage
**/.common-types
**/.env
**/*.log
